Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?Settings=20window:=20drop=20the=20Settings...?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20menu=20item,=20say=20=E4=BD=BF=E7=94=A8=E8=80=85=20not=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E7=94=A8=E6=88=B6,=20describe=20Lua=20plug-in=20settings,=20no?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20reset=20for=20reverse=20lookup?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Menu: remove "Settings..." (用戶設定); the folder button lives in the Penglai settings window
  (還原與進階: 打開使用者資料夾). "Sync user data" is now 同步使用者資料 / 同步使用者资料.
- All settings: Lua plug-in keys go into their own group 外掛模組, described by catalog keys with
  "lua" (script name) and optional "lua_ns"; documented keys are listed even when no file sets them.
- A local catalog overlay in the user folder (penglai-settings.local.json) adds descriptions for
  plug-ins only one machine has, so they stay out of the shipped catalog.
- Keys marked no_reset (stroke reverse lookup) get no 改回預設 button.
- --snapshot also captures every page of the 外掛模組 group; --script prints the plug-in rows.
---
 resources/Localizable.xcstrings       | 21 ++-------------------
 sources/SquirrelInputController.swift |  7 -------
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 26 deletions(-)

